    "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Before Playing</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This game is a horror game.\u00a0\u00a0</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If you have a weak heart or similar conditions, please refrain from playing.\u00a0\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There are certain scenes where the game may forcibly close as part of the experience.\u00a0\u00a0</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If you are streaming, please take care to avoid showing your desktop screen or similar content.\u00a0\u00a0</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3435270/extras/8bb244725eb6716d76a24b8338d4c16a.avif?t=1747860487\" data-has-big width=800 height=158 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Have you ever lost your memories?\u00a0\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Do you have precious memories?\u00a0\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Can you take the first step to regain them?\u00a0\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Even if it means involving everyone around you...</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Controls</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Z Button or Enter: Confirm\u00a0\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >X Button: Cancel or Open Menu Screen\u00a0\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Arrow Keys: Move Character\u00a0\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Shift Key: Dash\u00a0\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hold Z Button: Fast-forward</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Lastly</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This work is fiction.</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Before Playing</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This game is a horror game.\u00a0\u00a0</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If you have a weak heart or similar conditions, please refrain from playing.\u00a0\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There are certain scenes where the game may forcibly close as part of the experience.\u00a0\u00a0</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If you are streaming, please take care to avoid showing your desktop screen or similar content.\u00a0\u00a0</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3435270/extras/8bb244725eb6716d76a24b8338d4c16a.avif?t=1747860487\" data-has-big width=800 height=158 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Have you ever lost your memories?\u00a0\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Do you have precious memories?\u00a0\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Can you take the first step to regain them?\u00a0\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Even if it means involving everyone around you...</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Controls</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Z Button or Enter: Confirm\u00a0\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >X Button: Cancel or Open Menu Screen\u00a0\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Arrow Keys: Move Character\u00a0\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Shift Key: Dash\u00a0\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hold Z Button: Fast-forward</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Lastly</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This work is fiction.</p>",
